# operator/test/e2e diagnostics (`make e2e`/`make e2e-collect`). .e2e-bin/
# and the kubeconfig default to $(SHARED_DIR)-anchored paths outside this
# repo tree (see Makefile), so only the artifact dir needs ignoring here.
test/e2e/_artifacts/
# compiled e2e test binary from `go test -c` (test/e2e is its own module); the
# suite is run via `go run github.com/onsi/ginkgo/v2/ginkgo` (no on-disk
# binary), so any e2e.test left by a manual `go test -c` is pure artifact.
test/e2e/e2e.test
# exploratory spike scratch for the context-resumption investigation; the
# durable write-up lives in docs/spike-context-resumption.md. The spike/
# directory itself is tracked (other spikes ship their manifests), so only
# this subdirectory is ignored.
spike/context-resumption/
